{"event_type":"review","id":"786edfdaa52fb5706c6154961da975402f3ddbe8016c867d9b96fcf9ee4bf945","occurred_at":"2026-11-16T19:48:11Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/12b86e223d916c8f25a0a6af568e2b2b27bda8734e88fb8c5f51be5ed7224563","sha256":"12b86e223d916c8f25a0a6af568e2b2b27bda8734e88fb8c5f51be5ed7224563"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/4b61972fc6c05a01c64a68200befe4a83a2a2c7bbdb13b9b64b6c76c01436a38","sha256":"4b61972fc6c05a01c64a68200befe4a83a2a2c7bbdb13b9b64b6c76c01436a38"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/59b02912a004ec2c0cedc288a0c3726b53398c35583244c5a8925c4c6adb95fc","sha256":"59b02912a004ec2c0cedc288a0c3726b53398c35583244c5a8925c4c6adb95fc"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/42e1db39901567a7a1609bb4b26fb28e2791cd7a61029d2d4b348224e9e238ee","sha256":"42e1db39901567a7a1609bb4b26fb28e2791cd7a61029d2d4b348224e9e238ee"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/e52ebafd88e39ad8b707d06e0f44b2d5be10b5e6845b168c0fec08da437fba89","sha256":"e52ebafd88e39ad8b707d06e0f44b2d5be10b5e6845b168c0fec08da437fba89"}],"attempt_id":"0547cf1520ff8e5d89532e8678f722c175b57ad732f4fba15058f704b355066f:0:1","base":"7f6cfe7ea23081fe183fc3c8a7cb62f6da5104af","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"20eded846a8698e111f50e2abf119c4a07a2937d","body":"**An unreadable retained log can keep a local review pending.**\n\n`prepare` calls `c.classify` on each matching cycle's log at `apps/crq-python/local_review_runtime.py:101`. In `apps/crq-python/crq.py:496-497`, `classify` calls `ndjson.read_text(...)` when the file exists. That read sits outside the `try` block that handles `json.loads` errors, so an `OSError` from an existing but unreadable file leaves `prepare` through `local_review_runtime.py:101`. `reconcile_completed` catches `OSError` and sets a backoff of up to 240 minutes (`local_review_runtime.py:134-138`). The next attempt runs the same loop, reaches the same record, and raises again, because no path excludes that cycle. The item stays pending while the log remains unreadable.\n\nA missing log follows a different path. `classify` returns a non-counted result, and `local_review_runtime.py:102-103` skips that cycle. Decide how an unreadable cycle should be handled: skip it as a missing log is skipped, or fail it explicitly.","id":"b56f388346313d61c67cff23d28cafa7bb987625c7648ac3d547de70ab05e02c","intervals":[[101,101]],"path":"apps/crq-python/local_review_runtime.py","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"An unreadable retained log can keep a local review pending."}],"head":"0682c8effb4299687d1bbacbb0780ac884f7bca7","head_tree":"2a6378f38614c8b16a7d30447cf71e2ddc2985f6","input_scope":[{"blob":"20eded846a8698e111f50e2abf119c4a07a2937d","intervals":[[1,232]],"path":"apps/crq-python/local_review_runtime.py"},{"blob":"7a604f10cf2c0e40eb55d252c735f33b3a03ee58","intervals":[[1,285]],"path":"apps/crq-python/repair_prepare_live_vectors.py"},{"blob":"33b0153f80d92db395c840e66dfd8e5eb06ecbba","intervals":[[1,138]],"path":"apps/crq-python/review_admission.py"},{"blob":"6e7f2f56273a2e1466ceedcae60f0638007d11fd","intervals":[[1,350]],"path":"apps/crq-python/review_history.py"},{"blob":"0169381dc266409e575b4e9167106259ec153ab2","intervals":[[1,650]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_deploy_controller_health.py"},{"blob":"04a813b9980cf02a6a71538ac59a6bde4b0407d3","intervals":[[1,92]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_host_config_prepare.py"},{"blob":"32893303d397c0ea93b713c50f6d5362619ec360","intervals":[[1,451]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_package_runner.py"},{"blob":"0935dcca8fafc512cfda979cc5730c0c0896866a","intervals":[[1,337]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_review_history.py"}],"job_id":"0547cf1520ff8e5d89532e8678f722c175b5